  "prefLabel": "Lab 1505.02 Financial Information Update",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1505.02 Financial Information Update. The licensee shall submit to the department within 60 days after the end of each calendar quarter a certification by an independent certified public accountant that for such quarter all applicable federal and state payroll taxes have been paid on a timely basis in all such jurisdictions.\n\nSource. #10221, eff 11-3-12; ss by #13440, eff 8-24-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab1500.html"
}
